{{Quote|Command received a transmission from a probe droid in sector five.|ES-02 to CT-9904 "Crosshair"|<ref name="Rescue on Ryloth" />}}
'''Sector five''' was a location on the [[planet]] [[Ryloth]], situated just outside the [[capital]] [[city]] of [[Lessu City|Lessu]] and containing a large rock spire. The sector had an excellent vantage point into the city, and it was used by [[Clone Force 99]], [[Hera Syndulla]] and [[C1-10P|Chopper]] to scout out Lessu while planning to [[Rescue on Ryloth|rescue]] Syndulla's [[parent]]s. However, a [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[probe droid]] found the group and reported their location before [[Hunter]] destroyed it.<ref name="Rescue on Ryloth" />

